{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And no meat shall remain.</b> For if it remains overnight, the fixed time of its eating would not be apparent. Here Rashi commented: since it was stated only regarding the Passover of Egypt — but is it not written in the perasha of BeHa'alotkha, 'You shall leave none of it until morning,' and in the perasha of Ki Tissa, 'And it shall not remain overnight until morning, the slaughter of the festival passover-offering'?"], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:52:59.112802747Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}